text Route13_MoveRelearnerHouse_Text_TeachWhichMove {
    "Which move should I teach?"
}

text Route13_MoveRelearnerHouse_Text_NoMoveICanTeachThatMon {
    "Sorry…\p"
    "It doesn't appear as if I have a\n"
    "move I can teach that POKéMON."
}

text Route13_MoveRelearnerHouse_Text_CantTeachAnEgg {
    "Hmm? There isn't a single move\n"
    "that I can teach an EGG."
}

text Route13_MoveRelearnerHouse_Text_EndTutorMove {
    "Come back if you find some STARDUST\n"
    "and want your POKéMON to remember\l"
    "a move from its past."
}